1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,956
An American soldier

2
00:00:00,956 --> 00:00:02,439
is trapped behind enemy

3
00:00:02,439 --> 00:00:04,410
lines, his team is gone,

4
00:00:04,410 --> 00:00:05,683
and he is badly injured.

5
00:00:06,049 --> 00:00:06,946
But the person who will

6
00:00:06,946 --> 00:00:08,351
save him is someone

7
00:00:08,351 --> 00:00:09,488
he barely knows.

8
00:00:10,302 --> 00:00:11,551
John Kinley is serving

9
00:00:11,551 --> 00:00:12,859
in Afghanistan alongside

10
00:00:12,859 --> 00:00:14,146
Ahmed, a local

11
00:00:14,146 --> 00:00:14,776
interpreter.

12
00:00:15,259 --> 00:00:15,941
During a dangerous

13
00:00:15,941 --> 00:00:17,112
mission, their team

14
00:00:17,112 --> 00:00:18,132
is ambushed.

15
00:00:18,283 --> 00:00:19,337
John and Ahmed are

16
00:00:19,337 --> 00:00:20,415
the only survivors.

17
00:00:20,878 --> 00:00:22,420
Ahmed refuses to abandon

18
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:22,912
him.

19
00:00:23,083 --> 00:00:24,273
For days, he carries

20
00:00:24,273 --> 00:00:25,463
the wounded soldier across

21
00:00:25,463 --> 00:00:26,049
the mountains

22
00:00:26,049 --> 00:00:27,395
until they finally reach

23
00:00:27,395 --> 00:00:28,376
an American base.

24
00:00:28,859 --> 00:00:30,380
John returns home only

25
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:31,493
to discover that Ahmed

26
00:00:31,493 --> 00:00:32,741
and his family are still

27
00:00:32,741 --> 00:00:33,449
in danger.

28
00:00:33,834 --> 00:00:34,751
The promised documents

29
00:00:34,751 --> 00:00:35,473
that could bring them

30
00:00:35,473 --> 00:00:36,800
to America have never

31
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:37,488
arrived.

32
00:00:37,893 --> 00:00:39,283
So John makes a decision.

33
00:00:39,707 --> 00:00:40,937
He returns to Afghanistan

34
00:00:40,937 --> 00:00:42,595
to save the man who saved

35
00:00:42,595 --> 00:00:43,224
his life.

36
00:00:43,746 --> 00:00:44,722
Together with Ahmed's

37
00:00:44,722 --> 00:00:45,776
family, they make their

38
00:00:45,776 --> 00:00:46,751
way toward an evacuation

39
00:00:46,751 --> 00:00:47,517
point.

40
00:00:47,922 --> 00:00:48,683
Their enemies close

41
00:00:48,683 --> 00:00:50,873
in and escape seems impossible.

42
00:00:51,356 --> 00:00:52,644
Just when all hope seems

43
00:00:52,644 --> 00:00:54,205
lost, help finally

44
00:00:54,205 --> 00:00:54,893
arrives.

45
00:00:55,200 --> 00:00:56,488
John keeps his promise

46
00:00:56,488 --> 00:00:58,088
and saves the man who once

47
00:00:58,088 --> 00:00:58,934
saved him.

48
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,000
A PROMISE IS A PROMISE.

